The requested songs are those whose IDs occur in saved albums and also occur in the fully read liked-song collection.

```python
album_library_song_ids = set()
for album_record in album_library:
    album_library_song_ids.update(album_record["song_ids"])
target_songs_by_id = {}
for liked_song in liked_songs:
    if liked_song["song_id"] in album_library_song_ids:
        target_songs_by_id[liked_song["song_id"]] = liked_song
target_song_ids = sorted(target_songs_by_id)
target_song_candidates = [{"song_id": song_id, "title": target_songs_by_id[song_id]["title"]} for song_id in target_song_ids]
print(target_song_candidates)
```

